[en.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_NORTHERN]
Investigate §YNorthern Region§!

[en.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_NORTHERN_desc]
Though there are no obvious anomalies in the data from the Northern Region, if the smuggled foal’s breath is being transported out of the country by land, then the long border withn the dragons in the north will require a significant amount of investigation.

[zh.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_NORTHERN]
调查§Y北部地区§!

[zh.DECISION_C18_SMUGGLING_CASE_INVESTIGATE_NORTHERN_desc]
虽然北部地区数据上没有明显的异常，但是如果走私的稚马之息是通过陆路运输出境的，那么北方与龙族漫长的边境线就会有不小的调查工作量。
